## Layer 3 — Marketplace WO timeline (opt-in remote only)

**Skipped in local mock default.** Use only when user chose **DB + MP WO timeline** or **DB + MP + n8n** and **Live MP APIs** in pre-flight.

Requires **Live MP APIs** + n8n processed rows (or manual re-run).

1. **`MARKETPLACE_JWT`** from **`.env.e2e.local`**
2. Fetch messages: `GET {apiBase}/api/Chat/GetChatMessagesByJobTokenAsync?jobToken=<uuid>` (or equivalent per your MP build)
3. Count new lines since test start; compare text to `description` + `quoted_messages` from DB rows
4. **Context Capture** lines often use `MessageType` **2023** (`PM_Context_Updated_By_PMRoo`) after n8n

| Symptom | Likely cause |
|---------|----------------|
| DB 2 rows, MP 2 lines, **same quote twice** | LLM duplicated `quoted_messages` (Jun 8 case) |
| DB 2 rows, MP 4 lines | n8n retry or duplicate processing — check n8n + row `status` history |
| DB 0 rows, MP lines appear | Not PMRoo `register_pm_requests` — different ingress |
| DB rows `pending` forever (remote) | n8n flow **inactive** or failed (e.g. null `DefaultAssistantId`) |

---

## Layer 4 — n8n (opt-in remote only)

**Skipped in local mock default.** Only when user chose **DB + MP + n8n** verification, **Live MP APIs**, and flow is **active**.

- Workflow: `GenChat Action Requests V2.4 [Test]` (or user’s duplicate)
- **Read-only:** `GET /api/v1/executions?workflowId=…` — do not activate/deactivate/edit
- **`N8N_API_KEY`** from **`.env.e2e.local`** — never log
- Correlate execution time with `pm_action_requests.created_at`

If flow is off, report **`(n8n skipped — flow inactive)`** and rely on Layer 2 only.

