## Mixed-intent reference message

**Local mock (seed WO):** `for #158220-1 tenant is home tomorrow 2–4pm. Please have vendor call tenant.`

**Remote (example):** `for #WO-00139 tenant is home tomorrow 2–4pm. Please have vendor call tenant.`

| Row | type | quoted_messages (expected) |
|-----|------|----------------------------|
| 1 | Context Capture | factual slice (availability / context half) |
| 2 | Action Request | action slice (vendor call / instruction half) |

**Observed failure (2026-06-08):** both rows carried the **full** message → duplicate MP quote text.

